				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ellie3" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3656445); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3656445&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608349748" alt="Ellie3" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3656445)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ellie3" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3656445); return false;" >Ellie3</a></span> <span class="odate time_1554431290 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">05 Apr 2019 02:28</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4208212">
									

<p>One of the first tales (that isn't an Open Mic Night entry) for <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pieiswrong" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5214253); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5214253&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1554580052" alt="pieiswrong" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5214253)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pieiswrong" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5214253); return false;">pieiswrong</a></span>'s new GOI, Stacker's Coffeehouse and Bar!</p>
<p>Big thanks to the following peoples:</p>
<ul>
<li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yaitz331" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3483501); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3483501&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1554580052" alt="Yaitz331" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3483501)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yaitz331" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3483501); return false;">Yaitz331</a></span> for critique in #thecritters</li>
<li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pieiswrong" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5214253); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5214253&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1554580052" alt="pieiswrong" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5214253)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pieiswrong" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5214253); return false;">pieiswrong</a></span> for coming up with Stacker's and giving me a bit of info</li>
<li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/empresscoldspiritaj" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3142594); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3142594&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1554580052" alt="EmpressColdSpiritAJ" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3142594)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/empresscoldspiritaj" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3142594); return false;">EmpressColdSpiritAJ</a></span> for being a beta reader in the SCPD Discord</li>
<li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/duke-of-nothing" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4965379); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4965379&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1554580052" alt="Duke of Nothing" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4965379)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/duke-of-nothing" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4965379); return false;">Duke of Nothing</a></span> for their crit in the forums</li>
<li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/athosnetwork" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5012224); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5012224&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1554580052" alt="AthosNetwork" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5012224)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/athosnetwork" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5012224); return false;">AthosNetwork</a></span> for their crit in the SCPD Discord</li>
<li>And <em>especially</em> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rockteethmotheyes" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4022320); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4022320&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1554580052" alt="RockTeethMothEyes" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4022320)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rockteethmotheyes" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4022320); return false;">RockTeethMothEyes</a></span> for all their super-helpful crit in #thecritters!</li>
</ul>
<p>This was very fun to write, I hope Stacker's catches on in the community!</p>

